---
title: "Cabinet of curiosities"
note: "A naturalist's specimen in a glass cabinet, photographed for a museum catalogue, and a different one on every seed: @unique deals the creatures from one shuffled deck, so eight seeds give eight different animals before any comes back. Each is shot in three lights, one run each (@grid). Its legs, wings, catalogue number and year are numbers rolled in a range, the framing comes from any library in the frame/ folder (a glob), and every specimen has something wrong with it. @size makes it a catalogue page."
tags: [krea, photo, grid]
---
