$beast = __creature__
$light = {raking daylight from a tall window|the warm glow of a single candle|the hard white burst of a flashbulb}
@unique $beast
@grid $light
a museum catalogue photograph of a naturalist's specimen: a {|tiny |giant }$beast {IF $beast[bird]: with {2-4} wings|with {2-8} legs}, __subjects/twists__, pinned to black velvet inside a glass-fronted cabinet, a yellowed handwritten label beneath it reading "specimen no. {100-999}, collected {1850-1925}", {30% a brass magnifying glass leaning against the glass,} lit by $light, __frame/*__, dust and old fingerprints on the glass catching the light
